  (text "Generated by tools/kicad/gen_system_wiring.py from design_params.yaml - regenerate, don't hand-edit." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "70e2c6c9-45f7-5902-9bf9-787aa98e93dc"))
  (text "Connectivity machine-checked by tools/kicad/check_system_wiring.py." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "05819e4a-2d03-54be-9f3e-bbdf6ad7d410"))
  (text "Companion sheet: electronics/KiCAD/drive_mcu_wiring/ (pin-level drive harness). The two sheets share" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 37 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "73604074-98ed-59d6-bcc9-d0efcd99e158"))
  (text "+12V_BUS, GND_PWR, +5V_RAIL, +3V3, GND and ESTOP_STATE - follow a rail across both by net name." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "871bc8eb-b9cd-5566-bd35-4c556523573d"))
  (text "Protection chain: driver limit 8A/motor (firmware) -> BMS >= 50A -> fuse 60A -> E-stop contactor. ADR-0005." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 49 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "5ece10aa-0c54-5116-b360-b9b0aa2fb596"))
  (text "The E-stop opens +12V_BUS itself; K1's AUX_NC contact only REPORTS the state to the MCU on PB12." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 54 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "98ddf3e0-a77f-513d-b8a7-c6b69721e29f"))
  (text "The LD19 is powered from the Jetson USB port through the D300 adapter, not from +5V_RAIL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 59 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "c5e8e9c6-2dfb-5199-87f1-8398f2d98798"))
  (text "BNO086 sits on the Jetson 40-pin header (+3V3_JETSON), a different 3.3V rail from the Nucleo LDO's +3V3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "8cb78314-998a-5600-8e1b-29116ffda228"))
  (text "GND_PWR is the motor/battery return, starred at the pack; GND is the logic return. Single-point tie at the pack." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 69 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "fd758464-8492-52ec-b314-b155a226a4ff"))
